{"Title":"An Act facilitating cost efficient transportation","BillNumber":"S2205","DocketNumber":"SD284","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JMC0","Name":"Joanne M. Comerford","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JMC0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-12T12:01:06.797"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JMC0","Name":"Joanne M. Comerford","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JMC0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-12T12:01:06.7966667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2205/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Ms. Comerford, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2205) of Joanne M. Comerford for legislation to facilitate cost efficient transportation.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tThe first sentence of section 19A of chapter 90 of the General Laws is hereby amended by inserting after the figure “eighty-five” the following words:- ; provided, that a truck or other motor vehicle in combination with a trailer with a total weight equal to or less than 99,000 pounds may travel on a public way with such a permit.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}